   "CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] records:\n- API-key authentication\n- HEAD probes\n- WAL, busy_timeout and pool settings\n- the stats aggregation change\n- links.expires_at with the automatic schema upgrade\n- the expiry 410\n- PATCH expiry\n- the hourly stats endpoint\n- the MySQL collation note"
