   "method": "GET",
   "path": "/{code}",
   "summary": "Public redirect. Records exactly one click on success (best-effort). The HEAD /{code} twin (not in the schema) returns the same status and headers and records no click.",
   "request": "Path code, which must match ^[A-Za-z0-9]{1,32}$ or the response is 404 with no SQL. Optional Referer and User-Agent headers are stored, truncated to 2048 and 512 characters. Order of checks:\n1. Not found: 404.\n2. Deactivated: 410 'Link has been deactivated'.\n3. Expired (now >= expires_at): 410 'Link has expired'.\n4. Otherwise: 307.",
   "responses": {
